    "lyrics": "There was a better day, unlike today, where the vision inside decided to stay. Took the words that were true and a picture of you to the room where they rotted away. And then I came back to find out how it all began. Now I know this pen will never leave my hand. Won't you sing me to sleep? I can't stand the leak from the faucet that runs dry and drips like the tear from my eye.",
